  ['Measure stage wall time, tool time, retries and merge conflicts; record token use only if available. Separate measured values from estimates and unknowns.', 'Improve the demonstrated bottleneck using bounded independent work where appropriate. Keep correctness and failure containment gates intact.', 'Compare comparable before/after conditions including escaped defects and regressions. Complete when benefit is measured or the hypothesis is rejected.'],
